{"id":"5578254565969219","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md","title":"类映射、真类与成员结构初等性的显式数据","display":"df-class-embedding-data — 类映射、真类与成员结构初等性的显式数据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class-embedding-data","aliases":["58-df-class-embedding-data"],"display":"df-class-embedding-data — 类映射、真类与成员结构初等性的显式数据","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class-embedding-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class-embedding-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class-embedding-data — 类映射、真类与成员结构初等性的显式数据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,j\">\\(A,B,C,j\\)</span> 为元语言类变量，其元素均为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,p,\\kappa,\\varphi,s\\in V\">\\(x,y,z,p,\\kappa,\\varphi,s\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、类量词及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-class-satisfaction</code> 的类类型与有限公式递归。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)=\\{x\\in V:\\exists y\\in V\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)=\\{x\\in V:\\exists y\\in V\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\}\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span> 的范围内，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(x)\">\\(j(x)\\)</span> 表示满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,j(x)\\rangle\\in j\">\\(\\langle x,j(x)\\rangle\\in j\\)</span> 的唯一集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\circ s=\\{\\langle u,j(s(u))\\rangle:u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\">\\(j\\circ s=\\{\\langle u,j(s(u))\\rangle:u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\)</span>，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 为集合函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\\)</span> 时使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是下式确定的偏类算子，定义域为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\">\\(\\exists\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\)</span> 的类函数。各调用文件中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> 在类映射位置仅缩写这个算子，集合结构的既有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}\\)</span> 不变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,(A,\\in),(B,\\in))\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,(A,\\in),(B,\\in))\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\)</span> 的结构记法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\in)\">\\((A,\\in)\\)</span> 在此不是将真类装入集合有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 均按上述依赖文件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 不额外要求类可定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall p\\in j\\;\\exists x\\in A\\;\\exists y\\in B\\;(p=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall p\\in j\\;\\exists x\\in A\\;\\exists y\\in B\\;(p=\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists a\\in V\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists a\\in V\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,A,\\varphi)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\varphi,s)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B,\\varphi,j\\circ s)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,A,\\varphi)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\varphi,s)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B,\\varphi,j\\circ s)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)\n\\land\\langle\\kappa,\\kappa\\rangle\\notin j\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)\n\\land\\langle\\kappa,\\kappa\\rangle\\notin j\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\alpha,j)\n\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)=\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\alpha,j)\n\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)=\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处把已有调用中的元语言辅助概念写为形式关系，不把真类满意关系伪装成 ZFC 内的集合真谓词；可定义类与任意元语言类仍作区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C,j","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z,p,\\kappa,\\varphi,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)=\\{x\\in V:\\exists y\