entaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ClassAssignment}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(s,A,\\varphi)\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\varphi,s)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B,\\varphi,j\\circ s)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\\\\n&\\land\\kappa\\cup\\{\\kappa\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathrm{cls}}(j)\n\\land\\langle\\kappa,\\kappa\\rangle\\notin j\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in j).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\alpha,j)\n\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)=\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}_{58}(\\kappa,j)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":4039,"backlinks":[{"id":"38339d60720b0f2a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ClassCriticalPoint}$、$\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}$、$\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"4e04cbefb6776d1b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15ad878563670014","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2b89be05e707ab52","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ClassFunction}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},